  <str prefix="push_" suffix="aroundtheworld_act3hasstarted" key="push_aroundtheworld_act3hasstarted">回来并赢取 Norbert Van Houten 和他的飞机！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="aroundtheworld_maxvisitors" key="push_aroundtheworld_maxvisitors">你的城镇里到处都是游客！是时候收取他们的贡品了！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="aroundtheworld_maxvisitors24h" key="push_aroundtheworld_maxvisitors24h">这些游客准备好了！回来并点击他们吧！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="aroundtheworld_newnorberttasks" key="push_aroundtheworld_newnorberttasks">Norbert 有新的冒险任务可用！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="build_complete" key="push_build_complete">哦耶！新建筑！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="build_complete_alt" key="push_build_complete_alt">{0}完成了建造。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_androidsdungeon" key="push_buildingcomplete_androidsdungeon">Android's Dungeon漫画店已建成，而且Comic Book Guy归来啦。“有史以来，最糟的，世界末日。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_bartstreehouse" key="push_buildingcomplete_bartstreehouse">Bart的树屋已建成，而且Bart归来啦。“就我而言，我想要第一个站出来声明……这不是我干的。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_character1" key="push_buildingcomplete_character1">{0}已建成，而且{1}归来啦。“是时候来个什么人把我加进游戏里了！”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_character2" key="push_buildingcomplete_character2">{0}已建成，而且{1}归来啦。“想我了吗？”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_character3" key="push_buildingcomplete_character3">{0}已建成，而且{1}归来啦。“哟！回来的感觉真好。我欠你个人情！”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_cletusfarm" key="push_buildingcomplete_cletusfarm">Cletus农场已建成，而且Cletus归来啦。“回来的第一天，我就已经得到了块能蹲得下去的一流地段了！”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_eatery1" key="push_buildingcomplete_eatery1">{0}正在为客户服务。有你的地方就是克扣侍者工资的地方！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_eatery2" key="push_buildingcomplete_eatery2">{0}已经开始营业了。这是首家只雇佣老鼠的饭店。 </str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_eatery3" key="push_buildingcomplete_eatery3">{0}已经开始营业了。终于又有机会抵制这种不公平的无衬衫、无鞋、无服务政策了。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_firstchurchofspringfield" key="push_buildingcomplete_firstchurchofspringfield">Springfield第一教堂已建成，而且Lovejoy牧师归来啦。“记得，这或许是上帝为你们带来的第二次机会。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_generic1" key="push_buildingcomplete_generic1">{0}已完工！看来树木们又输了一场战争。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_generic2" key="push_buildingcomplete_generic2">{0}已完成！人们会永远将这个历史名迹作为……一个地方的。 </str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_home1" key="push_buildingcomplete_home1">{0}已完工。而且钥匙就在……糟糕，钥匙呢？！？</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_home2" key="push_buildingcomplete_home2">{0}已完成！新房子的气味不错吧？</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_home3" key="push_buildingcomplete_home3">{0}已完成。只是一个普通的房子，绝没有能杀人的地下室。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_krustyburger" key="push_buildingcomplete_krustyburger">Krusty汉堡店已建成，而且Krusty归来啦。“没有快餐和赞助公司要怎么改造社会呢？哈哈哈哈！”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_krustyland1" key="push_buildingcomplete_krustyland1">{0}刚刚来到了Krustyland！只有那个地方连排队等候也很有意思，快去吧！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_krustyland2" key="push_buildingcomplete_krustyland2">{0}刚刚来到了Krustyland！童年时期最大创伤之家！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_luigis" key="push_buildingcomplete_luigis">Luigi意式餐厅已建成，而且Luigi归来啦。“我来了！当你们厌倦了又老又黄的家伙们时，就会变成一个我这样的人，种族刻板印象者之一。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_moestavern" key="push_buildingcomplete_moestavern">Moe的酒馆已建成，而且Moe和Marge一同归来啦。“我们可以这样认为，他们俩正好都处于边缘地带……但一个在天堂，另一个则在地狱。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_policestation" key="push_buildingcomplete_policestation">警察局已建成，而且Wiggum警官归来啦。“这个城镇真是块无法无天的荒地。真希望有人能赶紧来好好管管这块地。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_powerplant" key="push_buildingcomplete_powerplant">冷却塔已建成，而且 Burns 先生归来啦。“非常好！首先我要恢复镇上的权力，然后我会……恢复电力。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_shop1" key="push_buildingcomplete_shop1">{0}已经开始营业了。终于开始贩卖那些能最终为你们带来幸福的东西了。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_shop2" key="push_buildingcomplete_shop2">{0}开业了！我敢打赌，你在为把剪彩用的大剪子忘在家里而自责呢。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_shop3" key="push_buildingcomplete_shop3">{0}开业了！请尽情在这里品尝，然后在网上选购，会优惠许多哦！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_springfieldelementary" key="push_buildingcomplete_springfieldelementary">Springfield小学已建成，而且Skinner归来啦。“啊，Springfield小学，我还以为我刚刚逃离了炼狱。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_springfieldlibrary" key="push_buildingcomplete_springfieldlibrary">Springfield图书馆已建成，而且Martin归来啦。“看，这里是新Springfield的黎明。放眼望去完全没有恃强凌弱的现象！”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_springfieldpenitentiary" key="push_buildingcomplete_springfieldpenitentiary">Springfield监狱已建成，而且Snake归来啦。“很好！是时候到外面的混乱世界破坏些什么玩意了！”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_springfieldretirementcastle" key="push_buildingcomplete_springfieldretirementcastle">养老院已建成，而且Grampa归来啦。“竟然没人注意到我这段时间消失了！护士呢！”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_townhall" key="push_buildingcomplete_townhall">城镇大厅已建成，而且Quimby市长归来啦。“呃，作为市长，我很荣幸能够为你们服务，呃，还有享受相应的待遇。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_twocharacter" key="push_buildingcomplete_twocharacter">{0}已建成。{1}和{2}一同归来啦。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_vanhoutenhome" key="push_buildingcomplete_vanhoutenhome">Van Houten家已建成，而且Milhouse归来啦。“我的房内空无一人，我好寂寞。这片新天地看上去和旧的一样糟。”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="buildingcomplete_williesshack" key="push_buildingcomplete_williesshack">Willie的棚屋已建成，而且Willie归来啦。“唉！就知道，当灾难摧毁了城镇时，你们就立刻跑来向清洁工求救！”</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="casino_gamblers" key="push_casino_gamblers">赌徒们想要回家。点击他们来把他们送回赌场！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="casino_maxgamblers24h" key="push_casino_maxgamblers24h">赌徒们想要摆脱赌瘾。点击他们来把他们拖回去。</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="casino_playcasinogame" key="push_casino_playcasinogame">您已经很久没赌了。这代表着您接下来肯定会赢，快来玩一局吧！</str>
  <str prefix="push_" suffix="christmas_mysterystocking" key="push_christmas_mysterystocking">用圣诞老人的金币获得限时物品，这是最后的机会！全都买过了？那就来看看全新的神秘袜子吧！</str>
